-- - Medium: 3.0 * 73 + 41.5 = 260.5 (matches CP160 legendary)
-- - Heavy: 4.0 * 73 + 54.5 = 346.5 (matches CP160 legendary)
-- - Shield: 20.0 * 73 + 260.0 = 1720 (matches CP160 legendary)
