-- NEITHER toggle. `facts.known === undefined` or `facts.isKnowledgeItem ===
-- undefined` fails closed (the field is unknown to the producer).
-- 
-- NOTE: recipe-specific / style-page-specific / motif-specific known-filtering (the
-- AF_RecipeFilters / AF_StylePageFilters cuts) is COMPOSED at the bar level by
-- combining this `knowledge` filter with the `item-type` filter — there is no
-- separate per-knowledge-kind filter.
